{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09705","headline":"送魏四落第还乡 · 岑参","name":"送魏四落第还乡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"东归不称意，客舍戴胜鸣。\n腊酒饮未尽，春衫缝已成。\n长安柳枝春欲来，洛阳梨花在前开。\n魏侯池馆今尚在，犹有太师歌舞台。\n君家盛德岂徒然，时人注意在吾贤。\n莫令别後无佳句，祗向垆头空醉眠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09705.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09705","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}